OL,9,G0855 Four in a Bed
OL,10,     FThe competition kicks off at The
OL,11,     FBickford Arms in Holsworthy,
OL,12,     FDevon, where self-confessed rookie
OL,13,     FKeith hopes that his hard work and
OL,14,     Fcharisma will impress his more
OL,15,     Fexperienced rivals.
OL,16,G0930 Four in a Bed
OL,17,     FAbby Norton hosts at Newchester
OL,18,     FFarmhouse B&B in Merriott,
OL,19,     FSomerset. The superstar beds and
OL,20,     Flacklustre linen receive mixed
OL,21,     Freactions, but all the guests are
OL,22,     Fwowed by Abby's hospitality.
OL,23,VppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppG1/13
