OL,5,G1000 Four in a Bed
OL,6,     FCollette and Danny hope to impress
OL,7,     Ftheir rivals at The Quay Inn in
OL,8,     FMinehead, Somerset. But will
OL,9,     Fcleanliness concerns, a damaged
OL,10,     Fbath panel and sausage squabbles
OL,11,     Fscupper their chances?
OL,12,G1030 Four in a Bed
OL,13,     FJustin and Mike host the final
OL,14,     Fvisit at Old Walls Vineyard Luxury
OL,15,     FLodges in Bishopsteignton, Devon.
OL,16,     FThe stunning location captivates
OL,17,     FAbby, but breakfast leaves Danny
OL,18,     Fegg-specting more...
