OL,5,G1105 Four in a Bed
OL,6,     FThe B&Bers meet for the last time
OL,7,     Fto settle some scores. After a
OL,8,     Fweek featuring Wi-Fi woes and a
OL,9,     Fbattle of the bangers, the
OL,10,     Fpayments are revealed and the
OL,11,     Fwinner is announced.
OL,12,G1135 Come Dine with Me
OL,13,     FDundee. The first host, alarm
OL,14,     Fcompany owner Bill, plans a
OL,15,     Fbelt-busting menu for his guests,
OL,16,     Fincluding the alarmingly named
OL,17,     F'death by peanut butter' dessert.
OL,18,     F(Ep1/5)
