OL,5,G1415 Four in a Bed
OL,6,     FThe first visit is to Newton House
OL,7,     Fin Knaresborough, North Yorkshire,
OL,8,     Frun by organic foodies Denise
OL,9,     FCarter and Jackie Fennell, who are
OL,10,     Fconfident that their breakfasts
OL,11,     Fhave set the bar high.
OL,12,G1450 Four in a Bed
OL,13,     FThe second visit is to the
OL,14,     FHighlands Pub in Blackpool, where
OL,15,     FMike Hayes and Neal Widdowson are
OL,16,     Fall about value for money. But
OL,17,     Fthere are North/South divisions at
OL,18,     Fdinner.
